        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/143106292?u=b3c5814362982b570863d2bb4e99cc0cc32ec862&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Added missing SVG attribute reference pages to fix the broken <code class=\"notranslate\">svgattr</code> links:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Pages added: <code class=\"notranslate\">offset</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">async</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">hreflang</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">ping</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">referrerPolicy</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">rel</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">xlink:actuate</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">xlink:role</code>.</li>\n<li>Replaced former SVG  <code class=\"notranslate\">title</code> link with a  plain text.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">To ensure that all SVG attributes referenced by <code class=\"notranslate\">SVGAttr</code> are documented and provide the browser compatibility data and usage details for SVG developers.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">xlink:role</code> may require a corresponding BCD update.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #44199.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4485600714\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44199\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/44199/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44199\">#44199</a></p>\n",
