        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55398995?u=9f6a9837c9879eceb0abde487a338b92d4e206fc&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">This goes hand-in-hand with <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4806222473\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44638\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/44638/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44638\">#44638</a>; both modify the same lists so they assume each other's existence. It's fine to have broken links in the interim period when one is merged and the other is not.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR is more mergeable than <code class=\"notranslate\">import source</code>, because Safari has already shipped full support in TP 251. V8 has it behind default-disabled flag; SM is still WIP.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45464",
            "title": "Reference for stage 3 defer-import-eval",
