            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69888?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">This PR includes the creation of four new reference pages:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">column-rule-inset-cap-start</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">row-rule-inset-cap-end</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">row-rule-inset-cap-start</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">rule-inset-cap</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Spec: <a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-gaps-1/#propdef-column-rule-inset-cap-end\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://drafts.csswg.org/css-gaps-1/#propdef-column-rule-inset-cap-end</a><br>\nThe <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Guides/Gaps\" rel=\"nofollow\">CSS gaps module page</a> is already live.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Part of <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4718339915\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/openwebdocs/project/issues/238\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/openwebdocs/project/issues/238/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/openwebdocs/project/issues/238\">openwebdocs/project#238</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">note: <a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45204\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/45204/hovercard\"><code class=\"notranslate\">column-rule-inset-cap-end</code></a> is in review.</p>",
