            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">This improves the <code class=\"notranslate\">No-Vary-Search</code> docs a little.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I wanted to fix a few tenses such as \" Indicates that URLs will not be cached\" . The message is sent by the server, so its an instruction to not cache, not an indication of somethign that will happen (it might not).</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Its also better to present this in terms of what is going on with the response.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related dcocs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5232627931\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45298\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/45298/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45298\">#45298</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45423",
            "title": "FF154 No-Vary-Search updates",
